        <rdfs:label>SyncreticRelationship</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Formalizes the syncretic equivalence between divine entities across different theological frameworks. Following CIDOC CRM E13, it treats syncretism as a propositional claim with associated epistemic authority and provenance.</skos:definition>
